Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.65,0:02:01.78,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}ko wo agete{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.65,0:02:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Raise your fist{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.38,0:02:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That is right, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.62,0:02:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shimotsuki Yasuie, Hakumai's former Daimyo\Nthat you loved has died!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.68,0:02:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Send him off with the sound of your laughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.95,0:02:30.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.56,0:02:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.24,0:02:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There you are, you damn brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you... If you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.91,0:02:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...did not laugh like an idiot at that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.31,0:03:01.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Komurasaki would not have had to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.59,0:03:04.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You little shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.01,0:03:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I will execute you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.68,0:03:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go to hell! You little shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.93,0:03:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Otoko, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.31,0:03:17.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Disappear from my sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.76,0:03:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"The Straw Hats Step In!\NAn Uproarious Deadly Battle at the Execution Ground!"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.93,0:04:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Th-They are...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.14,0:04:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Zorojuro the magistrate killer\Nand Sangoro the soba cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.02,0:04:43.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Those fools...\NI knew they couldn't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.59,0:04:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is gonna be trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.05,0:04:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But we can't really blame them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.59,0:04:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, they did a good job saving Otoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.63,0:05:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Zoro! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.63,0:05:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How dare you interfere with her execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.07,0:05:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,More friends of the rat have appeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.14,0:05:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yasuie's daughter...\NThat accursed brat is a serious criminal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.44,0:05:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, samurai! Go ahead and kill everyone\Nwho interferes with the execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.53,0:05:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.50,0:05:41.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, aren't they pointing \Ntheir guns this way?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.19,0:05:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.01,0:05:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Run, you idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.56,0:05:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.78,0:06:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, but I have no time for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.32,0:06:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Neither do I!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.88,0:06:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, go away, Browgoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.08,0:06:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Browgoro"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.29,0:06:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Sangoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.05,0:06:19.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You go away, Mossjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.79,0:06:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Mossjuro"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your head looks like a moss ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.15,0:06:25.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.39,0:06:28.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want me to chop you up\Nbefore Orochi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.07,0:06:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up! Then I'll kick you to death\Nbefore Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.15,0:06:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.43,0:06:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.97,0:06:39.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Otoko... Thank goodness she is okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.31,0:06:43.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is he... Zorojuro-{\i1}san{\i0}'s friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.33,0:06:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.23,0:06:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's our friend, too.\NHis name's Sangoro the soba cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.59,0:06:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sangoro-{\i1}san{\i0}... the soba cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.99,0:06:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Straw Hat Pirates' Roronoa Zoro,\Nand the other one is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.87,0:07:00.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Vinsmoke Sanji...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.97,0:07:04.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So the Straw Hats are really here\Nin the Land of Wano...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.56,0:07:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe that\Nthey showed their faces so brazenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.32,0:07:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.26,0:07:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have a problem with\Nthe way we appeared?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.19,0:07:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, do you?! And...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.35,0:07:19.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...don't ever call me Vinsmoke, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.85,0:07:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, I'll just finish you off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.53,0:07:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.57,0:07:37.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That damn ronin...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.75,0:07:39.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Next! Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.83,0:07:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take Otoko and run already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.39,0:07:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He needs to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.93,0:08:00.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That rat is behaving impertinently...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.94,0:08:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take care of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.58,0:08:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.61,0:08:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is he going to attack?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.02,0:08:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fight him! Fight him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.04,0:08:14.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That ronin is going to attack me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.24,0:08:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Run, Browgoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.24,0:08:24.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How could that lowly bastard be so rude?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.42,0:08:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I gotta cut you myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:31.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Moss!\NDon't rush into a fight on your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.65,0:08:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.67,0:08:34.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.59,0:08:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.51,0:08:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Stop, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.26,0:08:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tonoyasu sacrificed himself for what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.31,0:08:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Whoa, wait a minute, mister!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.65,0:08:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As they say, there are evens and odds in this world.\NBoth good and evil come in turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.62,0:08:58.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's put an end to this here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.71,0:08:59.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.91,0:09:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In this country,\Nwe call everyone's smiling face...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.54,0:09:08.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,..."{\i1}Ebisu gao{\i0}," mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.54,0:09:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's why this place is called Ebisu Town!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.51,0:09:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Poverty won't get us down!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:17.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yasu...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:25.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Could it be that he is Akazaya's soldier?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, you samurai! Protect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,720-Pound Phoenix!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.66,0:09:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who is that man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.31,0:09:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Boss Kyoshiro...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.10,0:09:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He repelled Zoro's sword attack?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.02,0:09:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think he was the one who cut Komurasaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.57,0:09:59.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Boss Kyoshiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.24,0:10:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, he is the boss of the hoodlums\Nwho caused that trouble at my soba shop?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.90,0:10:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Lord, you are too careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.78,0:10:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should not come to the execution ground\Nwith such poor security.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.55,0:10:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you are right...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.33,0:10:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And that ronin...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.45,0:10:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He was really going to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.83,0:10:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Moss! What are you thinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.05,0:10:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Chill out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.26,0:10:39.93,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,X. DRAKE\NDRAGON-DRAGON FRUIT, ALLOSAURUS MODEL
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.05,0:10:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A surprise attack from one so big?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.47,0:10:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.81,0:10:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.57,0:11:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, well. This is going \Nto be a scene of bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:06.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What should we do?\NAre we gonna stand here and just watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.97,0:11:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When it comes to this,\Nwe gotta fight, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.83,0:11:15.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a minute!\NThat will ruin the whole plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.19,0:11:20.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And if we get involved with this,\Nwe can no longer stay in the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.51,0:11:25.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even so, we can't let them expose Yasuie-{\i1}sama{\i0}'s body\Nto public view!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.68,0:11:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We must take it away somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.10,0:11:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You are right, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.41,0:11:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's split up.\NWhere should we meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.54,0:11:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll help fight, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.29,0:11:42.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, wait! Now is not the right time for\NOden-{\i1}sama{\i0}'s allies to show themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.91,0:11:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. Shinobu-{\i1}chan{\i0} and Kanjuro,\Nhead out discreetly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.14,0:11:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.30,0:11:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's our crewmembers who created this mess,\Nso we'll take care of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.17,0:11:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.51,0:12:01.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Shinobu!\NLeave it to Onami-{\i1}dono{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.64,0:12:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take Shogun-{\i1}sama{\i0} to the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.06,0:12:15.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know what to do! Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.11,0:12:19.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kill every single person\Nwho rebels against me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.57,0:12:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.74,0:12:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.91,0:12:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.72,0:12:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.29,0:12:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bulletproof?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.62,0:12:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's up with that carpenter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.00,0:12:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Strong Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who are they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.43,0:12:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who in the world are they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.49,0:12:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, there he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.60,0:12:55.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No! He stole Yasuie-{\i1}sama{\i0}'s body!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.32,0:12:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.83,0:13:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry!\NI won't let them desecrate his body!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.74,0:13:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.41,0:13:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.99,0:13:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! Usohachi! Thanks! You saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.16,0:13:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On top of that ladder! Aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.29,0:13:25.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa-whoa! A sniper getting sniped\Nis too much irony!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.01,0:13:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mil Fleurs!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.51,0:13:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gigantesco Mano Spank!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Orobi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.14,0:13:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Another one appeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.28,0:13:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She was...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.70,0:13:43.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...the geisha from that time...\NI knew she was a magic user.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.98,0:13:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The enemies are strong. Surround them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.37,0:13:50.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Onami!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.20,0:13:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Leave them to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.58,0:13:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thunderbolt Tempo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.37,0:13:59.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Outta my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.55,0:14:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think not!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.93,0:14:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.14,0:14:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll cut you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.66,0:14:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Outta my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.75,0:14:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think not!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.13,0:14:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.84,0:14:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll cut you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.27,0:15:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I am the Shogun's dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.81,0:15:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Zorojuro-{\i1}san{\i0}... Kyoshiro...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.59,0:15:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You need to get out of the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.34,0:15:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But what about Toko?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.66,0:15:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She'll be fine because\Nshe's with the strong man named Sangoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.83,0:15:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Poele A Frire Spectre!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.04,0:15:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's wrap this up and get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.17,0:15:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.47,0:15:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Special Attack Atlas Comet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.22,0:15:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mil Fleurs, Gigantesco Mano!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.22,0:15:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Weapons Left!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.27,0:15:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tornado Tempo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.87,0:15:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All soldiers! Fight them! Fight them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.58,0:16:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rebels are rioting in Rasetsu Town!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.04,0:16:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,According to the Shogun's command,\Nit does not matter if they're dead or alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.14,0:16:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Feel free to kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.38,0:16:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.71,0:16:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kick their asses!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.86,0:16:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Way to go!\N--Hey, straw hat man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.20,0:16:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are those your crew\Nthat the Light-Scroll Snail is showing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.41,0:16:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? I think I've been told\Nto keep it a secret...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.10,0:16:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, who cares...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.56,0:16:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.40,0:16:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--There! Do it, do it! Take them down!\N--This is no good...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.25,0:16:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Zorojuro! You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.42,0:16:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.28,0:16:39.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That green-head is your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.34,0:16:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's Zorojuro, the serious criminal\Nwho killed a magistrate, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.33,0:16:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Like I said, I don't know him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.02,0:16:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's too obvious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.01,0:16:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How interesting!\NOf all people, he's trying to kill Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.01,0:16:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That scum deserves to be chopped up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.11,0:16:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.47,0:17:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But he's up against Kyoshiro\Nwho is quite tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.48,0:17:11.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What, Babanuki?\NIt's getting exciting now. I'm sure this can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.13,0:17:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But a criminal has just arrived\Nfrom the Flower Capital...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.16,0:17:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,From the Flower Capital?\NWho came now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.93,0:17:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The criminal will arrive soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.37,0:17:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Through that gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.92,0:17:33.59,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,HITOKIRI
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.76,0:17:35.22,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,SERIOUS CRIMINAL
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.43,0:17:43.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.16,0:17:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's a useless piece of garbage who couldn't fulfill a mission\Nassigned by the Shogun at the Flower Capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.27,0:17:53.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We have a message from Orochi-{\i1}sama{\i0}\Nsaying you can punish him as you like!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.49,0:18:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We brought Hitokiri Kamazo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.64,0:18:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you're Kamazo...\NI've heard so much about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.81,0:18:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And there's one more!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.63,0:18:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.60,0:18:18.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have a report!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.85,0:18:24.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,While we were escorting Kamazo here,\Nwe caught another crook!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.73,0:18:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The escapee, Captain Kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.10,0:18:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Jaggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.44,0:18:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you know?!\NAll jailbreakers are to be executed immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.92,0:18:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, death penalty!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.99,0:18:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You came back so quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.16,0:18:44.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, how did you catch him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.22,0:18:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it was so easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This fool came towards us\Nyelling something,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.34,0:18:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,so I shot him a couple of times,\Nbut he didn't even try to run and here we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.26,0:19:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe he forgot that\Nhe has some Sea Prism Stone cuffs on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.46,0:19:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kid! You're so dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.98,0:19:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He took the trouble of escaping,\Nso why did he surrender himself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.04,0:19:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.75,0:19:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I said stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.71,0:19:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I remember how you didn't \Nlike the way you laugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.59,0:19:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You even stopped laughing \Nout loud at some point...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.48,0:19:51.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone who mocked your laugh\Nwould be nearly beaten to death by you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.86,0:19:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please... stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.10,0:20:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You started wearing a mask to hide your face\Nat some point...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.16,0:20:05.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's the person I knew...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.88,0:20:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.41,0:20:11.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After we got separated,\Nwhat did Kaido do to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.76,0:20:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Or did Orochi do something to you?!\NWhere's everyone else?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.17,0:20:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.26,0:20:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, answer... Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.01,0:20:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Killer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.97,0:20:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! That's him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.06,0:20:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Straw hat man, do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.44,0:20:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.24,0:20:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Alright, Straw Hat...\NI'm glad I got a chance to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.16,0:20:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But next time we meet,\NI won't show any mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.04,0:20:56.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:20:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.10,0:21:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...I'm going to find the One Piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.68,0:21:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kid! What're you \Njust standing there for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.33,0:21:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know, Killer...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.36,0:21:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On our journey up to this point,\Nwe've been laughed at and ridiculed
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.66,0:21:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,whenever we mentioned getting our hands\Non the One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.61,0:21:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And each time that happened,\NI slaughtered everyone who laughed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.75,0:21:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But what lies ahead is a sea of death\Nfor those who don't got the guts to mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.14,0:21:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's meet again in the New World!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.92,0:21:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.60,0:21:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that the masked guy who was with Jaggy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.68,0:21:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Jaggy must've tried to save him...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.14,0:22:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How cruel...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.15,0:22:08.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He was forced to eat the Smile fruit\Nand was given a mask of laughter that he can never take off...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.71,0:22:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn Orochi... How could \Nhe do such a thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.88,0:22:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What did they do to change you completely?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.68,0:22:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who did this to my buddy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.56,0:22:40.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's my crew?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.77,0:22:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.78,0:22:52.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, balloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.58,0:22:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Straw hat man?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.12,0:22:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.58,0:23:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want, Straw Hat?!\NWhy are you yelling?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.04,0:23:06.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, let's just start the sumo matches!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.63,0:23:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.73,0:23:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If Luffy dies, Kid and Killer \Nwill be freed from torture!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.37,0:23:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Queen, who toys with people's lives,\Nresumes the Sumo Inferno!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.40,0:23:32.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Bearing responsibility for their fate,\NLuffy is as determined as ever and gives it all he has!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.49,0:23:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}He finally faces off against Queen!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.14,0:23:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On the next episode of One Piece!\N"Luffy's Determination! Win Through the Sumo Inferno!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.38,0:23:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.38,0:23:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.38,0:23:49.38,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,
